        +-------------------+
        |   Bridge Network  |
        +--------+----------+
                 |
   ---------------------------------
   |               |               |
   v               v               v

+--------+    +--------+    +--------+
| Cont 1 |    | Cont 2 |    | Cont 3 |
| NS + IP|    | NS + IP|    | NS + IP|
+--------+    +--------+    +--------+
